<title>JAPAN: Recruit Cosmos -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Recruit Cosmos -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 82.08		vs	   91.76</p>
<p> Operating	    6.10		vs	   10.08</p>
<p> Current	    453    million	  vs	  390    million</p>
<p> Net		  429    million	  vs	  370    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.45 yen	  vs	    6.43 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     58 million	  vs	  58 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Recruit Cosmos Co Ltd is a real estate company.</p>
